OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe floods wildlife meadow
OL,4,Afor fourth time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife charity fears it could lose
OL,7,Fa funding grant after a burst pipe
OL,8,Fprevented vital conservation work.
OL,10,FIt is the fourth time Long Mead Local
OL,11,FWildlife Site, at Swinford in
OL,12,FOxfordshire, has been flooded because
OL,13,Fof a mains failure.
OL,15,FAlthough the meadow by the River Thames
OL,16,Fnaturally floods in the winter,
OL,17,Fstanding water at this time of year can
OL,18,Fcause damage to the rare habitat.
OL,20,FThames Water said the latest leak had
OL,21,Fbeen fixed and it remained committed to
OL,22,Fprotecting local wildlife sites.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
